Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Bănci
For our client, an important banking institution, we are looking for a Network Security Engineer. 
 Main Responsibilities: 
Designing, implementing and managing data communication networks, ensuring optimal performance reliability and security;
Implementing and managing network security solutions such as firewalls, WAF, IPS, NAC and VPN to protect data and infrastructure;
Collaborating with IT infrastructure and development teams to deliver network and infrastructure projects efficiently, ensuring alignment with sprint goals, timelines and security standards;
Supporting IT or business sponsored projects to ensure they meet networking and security requirements;
Communicating complex network concepts to technical and non-technical stakeholders;
Maintaining detailed network documentation, including diagrams, configurations, and procedures, ensuring they are up to date;
Acting as 2nd level support for troubleshooting network security related end-user issues and resolving them in a timely manner.
 The Ideal Candidate: 
Technical University degree;
5+ years work experience;
Hands-on installation, configuration, troubleshooting experience on any of Cisco, Fortinet, Palo Alto firewalls, including VPN, IPS and remote access;
Hands-on installation, configuration experience with NAC setup;
Experience with administration of enterprise level load balancers;
Proficient in both verbal and written English;
Enthusiastic and willing to learn, with a can-do attitude and a strong work ethic;
Good communicator, able to communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical audiences;
Appreciates change controls and has the ability to follow defined procedures;
Forward-thinking and keen to make suggestions on ways to drive forward the organization's security services;
Flexible and adaptable, able to provide solutions to security challenges in a changing environment;
Good time management and organizational skills.
 Please apply online with a detailed CV or send in your application to roxana.grososiu@lugera.ro. All suitable candidates will be contacted within 2 weeks. If your profile is not matching the criteria for this role, don’t worry, it will be redirected to the consultants managing projects better fitting your expertise.
 All information will be treated as strictly confidential.
